        "_doc": "Externally generated narration (e.g. Gemini TTS / Google AI Studio). One file per voice.lines entry, in order: line-01.wav = vo1 ... line-09.wav = vo9 (or vo1.wav...). Any sample rate/channels; voice.py trims silence, applies voice.processing, converts to 48 kHz mono and enforces max_s (no time-stretch). Use: VOICE_PROVIDER=file npm run voice (or set provider to \"file\").",
